html += '''
</table>

<p>Checkmates naturally require more moves to execute, while resignations tend to occur earlier when one player recognizes a losing position. Timeouts produce the shortest games on average, as players burn clock time in complex positions.</p>
'''

# ====== SECTION 4: OPENINGS ======
html += f'''
<h2 id="opening-strategy">4. Opening Analysis: Popular Openings and Their Success Rates</h2>

<p>The dataset contains <strong>{op['total_unique_openings']}</strong> unique opening names across <strong>{op['total_unique_eco']}</strong> ECO codes. This section focuses on the <strong>top 15 openings by frequency</strong>, analyzing their win rates for both colors and identifying openings where black performs unusually well.</p>

